\par 1.1. C}{\f214\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 \'f5}{\f0\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967  quan ch\u7911\'3f d\u7921\'3f \'e1n l\'e0 B\u7897\'3f N\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 Ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn n\'f4ng th\'f4n (B\u7897\'3f NN PTNT). }{
\f206\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 \'d0\u7875\'3f}{\f0\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967  tri\u7875\'3fn khai d\u7921\'3f \'e1n v\'e0 ph\u7889\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft }{\f206\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 \'f0}{
