\f0\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 ng.
\par 1.2. Ban Qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd d\u7921\'3f \'e1n t\u7881\'3fnh l\'e0 m\u7897\'3ft trong c\'e1c Ban Qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd d\u7921\'3f \'e1n t\u7881\'3fnh (5 t\u7881\'3fnh) v\'e0 v\'f9ng }{\f206\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 \'f0}{
