\f0\insrsid10565967\charrsid10565967 \u7875\'3f th\u7921\'3fc thi d\u7921\'3f \'e1n.
\par 1.9. Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f l\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng N\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 Ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn n\'f4ng th\'f4n Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam (Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng NN PTNT).
